    "regime_notes": "Positive 10-day IC in 2021, 2022, 2024-2027 and partial 2030; negative in 2020, 2023, 2028 and 2029. Strongest tested horizon is 20 days, while 10 days satisfies benchmark admission gates. Interpret uncertainty conservatively due to 15-asset cross-section.",
